  "jobTitle": "Full Stack Web Developer",
  "summary": "I design and build websites for businesses and organizations across the central U.P. and throughout the Midwest.\n\nI've spent about twenty years building websites and software. For much of that time I worked with agencies and creative studios in Chicago, on everything from marketing sites, online stores, museum exhibits, mobile apps, and trade show kiosks for names like John Deere, Toshiba, and the Field Museum.\n\nMy specialties are custom website design, WordPress development, and ongoing support that keeps sites secure, backed up, and running fast. I build sites so clients can make their own updates, and I take on custom software when a project calls for it. Twenty years in, launching a new site is still my favorite part of the job.",
